GeoNames
--------
Place-name data (the offline geocoder's `lib/ingest/data/places.bin.gz`,
used by `lib/ingest/geo.ts`, and the worldwide named-peaks index
`lib/mapdata/peaks.bin.gz`, built by `scripts/build-peaks.mjs` and read by
`lib/ingest/peaks.ts`) is derived from the GeoNames geographical database
(https://www.geonames.org/), licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) — the codebase's
own attribution string (`lib/photobook/strings.ts`): "Place names from
GeoNames.org, under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 licence."

HydroSHEDS
----------
River and lake data (`lib/mapdata/hydro-world.json.gz`, built by
